    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To estimate The global budget allocated to the project, our need to calculate the total revenue over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, which translates to an average annual revenue of 750,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The global budget allocated to the project, our can estimate The global budget allocated to the project as follows:  Projected Margin = Average Annual Revenue * Target Gross Margin Percentage Projected Margin = 750,000 euros * 0.28 Projected Margin = 210,000 euros per year Over 4 years, the total projected margin would be approximately 840,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the project financial sustainability and optimize costs, our can propose the following strategies: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fixed Costs Optimization: our cost structure indicates that fixed costs account for 35% of project costs. our can explore opportunities to renegotiate rates with subcontractors or optimize our internal resource allocation to reduce fixed costs. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Variable Costs Management: With variable costs accounting for 65% of project costs, our can focus on efficient resource utilization, streamlining processes, and implementing cost-effective solutions to minimize 65% of project costs. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Infrastructure Margin Optimization: our pricing model includes an infrastructure margin of 12%. our can investigate options to reduce infrastructure costs while maintaining the required level of service, thereby optimizing an infrastructure margin of 12%. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Software Licence Resale Margin Optimization: Although not directly applicable to the project, our software licence resale margin is 8%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If software licences are involved in the project, our can explore opportunities to optimize our software licence resale margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these cost-optimization strategies and maintaining our target gross margin percentage, our can ensure the financial sustainability of the project while delivering value to the client within the allocated budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must provide intelligent assistance to agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components can we design to meet these requirements, and how will we LLM stack support The expected solution functional scope?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are there any known trade-offs or limitations we should consider when proposing we AI-powered solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide intelligent assistance to agents, we can design an AI component that utilizes a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) approach, leveraging we expertise in RAG capabilities. design would involve integrating a vector store such as Qdrant or Weaviate with a large language model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is we preferred sovereign model due to Mistral 7B Instruct strong French-language performance and self-hostable nature. our LLM stack can support the solution's functional scope by providing features such as semantic search, question-answering, and text generation. we can fine-tune we models using methods like LoRA or QLoRA to adapt our models to the specific domain and tone of the administrative services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can utilize quantization methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ) to optimize model performance while reducing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we must consider known trade-offs and limitations when proposing our AI-powered solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, there is a trade-off between explicability and performance, as sovereign open-weight models like Mistral 7B Instruct may achieve slightly lower relevance scores compared to larger proprietary models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, we have accepted a trade-off between explicability and performance for compliance reasons." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another limitation is the need for offline quarterly fine-tuning on anonymized data due to GDPR constraints, which prohibits real-time learning from user data. we should also be mindful of the model size versus energy consumption trade-off, as we preferred model, Mistral 7B, with INT8 quantization uses approximately 80% less energy than larger models with comparable task performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we should consider the model size versus energy consumption trade-off, reserving fine-tuning for domain tone and format adaptation while using RAG for frequently updated knowledge bases." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully weighing known trade-offs and limitations, we can design an effective AI-powered solution that meets the client's requirements and constraints while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and minimizing environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint by reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we propose a solution that contributes to aims, and what sustainability metrics can we use to measure the solution's environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose a solution that aligns with aims by leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capabilities in digital sobriety practices and green hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has established partnerships with green hosting providers, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which offer 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By hosting the solution's on green hosting providers, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, which offer 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can significantly reduce the carbon footprint associated with data centers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy. our digital sobriety practices are designed to minimize energy consumption while maintaining performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. estimate that our digital sobriety practices can reduce typical energy reduction versus baseline by around 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To measure the environmental impact of the solution's, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can use metrics such as Scope 1 and 2 greenhouse gas emissions (tCO2e), which Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have already measured for Nexus Engineering S.r.l. own operations, totaling 148 tCO2e." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also conduct regular carbon reporting using GRI Standards, albeit partially." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By proposing a solution that incorporates these sustainable practices and hosting options, we can contribute to aims." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. sustainability metrics will enable Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to monitor and report on the environmental impact of the solution's, ensuring transparency and accountability throughout the solution's deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposes a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience in managing public sector projects, specifically in digital transformation, AI solutions, and smart cities, with 23 completed projects and expertise in EU-established regulations. a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will provide intelligent assistance to agents, facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, and reducing processing times. a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will integrate with existing practices and systems, ensuring a seamless experience for agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, data engineering, and cybersecurity to design a technical architecture that meets a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks requirements. a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will cover functionalities such as assistance with information consultation, drafting, and file instruction. a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will provide accurate and relevant information to agents, ensuring explicability and transparency through techniques like chain-of-thought prompting and RAG source citation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technology stack supports the functional scope, focusing on AI/ML for intelligent assistance, cloud architecture for scalability and reliability, API integration for seamless connectivity, data engineering for efficient information management, and cybersecurity measures like encryption (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit) to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will guarantee strict adherence to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), hosting data exclusively within EU-established, protecting sensitive data through encryption or anonymization if necessary, and ensuring no transfer of data outside EU-established." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), appoints a Data Protection Officer, and uses Microsoft Presidio for self-hosted anonymization. a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks will be designed as a tool of assistance, not automating decisions without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will provide drafting administrative content assistance and ensure that a comprehensive solution to meet the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist municipal agents in their daily tasks is explicably transparent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

