    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing security controls, certifications, and compliance capabilities, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that the solution's meets The City of Belval strict the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) requirements regarding data hosting, protection, and transfer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The call for tenders emphasizes the importance of respecting regulatory requirements, including GDPR compliance, explicability, and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also be designed as a tool of assistance, with no decision automated without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements outlined in The call for tenders? we should flag the following legal risks: open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow, AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation.  we is compliant with GDPR as we standard legal basis is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a DPA template version 3.2. we also provide dpia support and do not process sensitive data by default." ;
