    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All we subcontractors must be EU-established, which aligns with the requirement of not transferring data outside of EU. we standard contractual clauses include an SLA penalty mechanism, termination for cause notice days, termination for convenience notice days, data return on termination days, and a data destruction certificate. we also have a price revision mechanism based on annual indexation capped at the official national index, with a maximum of 3% per year. we are capable of providing assistance with drafting administrative content, and we solution is designed as a tool of assistance, which aligns with the requirements outlined in The call for tenders." ;
